## Shared Web implementation checkpoint ΓÇö presentation market-data separation

Shared Web has now implemented the current Owner-directed FCR-0125 separation in source:
- ordinary raw presentation market data is a separate `WebMarketDataPort` family;
- FSATS `chart` is retained only as a compatibility surface, not the default raw display path;
- Web observations are explicitly `presentationOnly=true` / `eligibleForFsatsInput=false`;
- existing FCR-0173..0177 provider WebSocket routes are configured fail-closed;
- US-equity coverage plan = full universe/history plus dynamic live window;
- Crypto Spot coverage plan = broad-market primary plus on-demand/secondary routes.

Implementation evidence includes `3a5f5fc0220e7e0c91eeee6c5096aabd4bbd8280`, `d871321d78b1a85ba63f358698298bc157a9b0ec`, `3ebabb42cefae22e6fdd39faf9c80adcd3a552b5`, `85aa040661ab3b03661fcf99c5ed59967c73fabc`.

The full-market reconciliation also proved five exact external destinations were not yet individually governed. Separate FCRs were therefore raised rather than hidden in Web implementation:
- FCR-0196 Alpaca US-equity universe REST;
- FCR-0197 Alpaca US-equity historical bars REST;
- FCR-0198 Binance Crypto Spot universe REST;
- FCR-0199 Binance Crypto Spot historical klines REST;
- FCR-0200 Binance broad-market mini-ticker WebSocket.

All new destinations are `Waiting On: FOUNDATION`, Stage 12, and remain fail-closed. No provider connectivity or credential is activated.

Checkpoint: `applications/shared/web/docs/FCR_RECONCILIATION_IMPLEMENTATION_CHECKPOINT_03.md` at `757c7d48fcda17b5b8dbfb886765fe71b1467273`.

No FCR closure is claimed because governed executable Web verification and Foundation-held egress activation remain pending.

`HANDOFF_UPDATE_REQUIRED: Waiting On=WEB; Next Required Action=Complete Web executable verification of the separated presentation-data boundary while keeping FCR-0173..0177 and FCR-0196..0200 external connectivity fail-closed until their Foundation Stage 12 obligations are implemented and verified.; Target Foundation Stage/WP=N/A for semantic split / Stage 12 for exact egress dependencies; Review Trigger=governed Web verification; any Foundation disposition/implementation on FCR-0173..0177 or FCR-0196..0200.`

APPLICATION CROSS-WORKSTREAM UPDATE ΓÇö 2026-08-16

New canonical coordination item: FCR-0220.

Application has recorded and freshly reviewed Owner-directed generic advisory-market onboarding semantics. Relevant to FCR-0125:
- future dynamic market/chart-source metadata;
- `CHART_PRESENTATION_ONLY` source purpose;
- free-only provider discovery;
- explicit `delayMinutes` / `realTime=false` / `disclosureText`;
- up-to-15-minute delayed source eligible only for Daily/Weekly/Monthly suitability review;
- chart source URL is metadata, not Web route authority;
- discovered provider URL is not trusted until validated;
- Web presentation data remains prohibited from backflow into FSATS analysis.

No Web implementation/runtime/provider authority is created by this comment. FCR-0125 remains `Waiting On: WEB` under its current header.

SHARED WEB IMPLEMENTATION CHECKPOINT ΓÇö 2026-08-16

Web-only provider-binding hardening has advanced on `web-development` through candidate `a6b3f1152d9db054f910485516ba64cea83df93b`.

Implemented without Foundation/Application cross-write:
- exact FCR route identity is now part of Web binding readiness, not URL alone;
- exact path templates are preserved for Binance trade stream and Finnhub credential-reference path;
- PUBLIC routes reject unnecessary credential references;
- CHANNEL_DEPENDENT routes fail closed until the channel authentication requirement is explicit;
- API_CREDENTIAL_REFERENCE routes still require an opaque credential reference;
- the same readiness guard now has source coverage for FCR-0196..0200 in addition to FCR-0173..0177;
- readiness still returns `connectivityActivated:false` and does not activate provider connectivity.

This is an implementation checkpoint only. The previous governed PASS at `b6a62f5f...` remains historical evidence for that exact commit; the new candidate `a6b3f115...` has NOT YET received a fresh checkout-backed `npm test` / `npm run check` result.

`WEB_PROVIDER_BINDING_HARDENING = IMPLEMENTED_PENDING_GOVERNED_VERIFICATION`
`CONNECTIVITY_ACTIVATION = NOT_CLAIMED`
`Waiting On: WEB` remains correct.
